      "source_name": "reseller-05.txt",
      "text": "Reseller Agreement\nA. Appointment\nThe Company appoints the Reseller as a non-exclusive reseller of the Products in the Territory.\n\nB. Reseller Obligations\nThe Reseller shall use commercially reasonable efforts to promote and sell the Products and shall not make any representation or warranty on the Company's behalf.\n\nC. Pricing and Discounts\nThe Company shall sell the Products to the Reseller at the discount set out in Schedule 1, and the Reseller may set its own resale prices.\n\nD. Orders and Acceptance\nAll orders placed by the Reseller are subject to acceptance by the Company, and no order is binding until the Company issues a written order confirmation.\n\nE. Intellectual Property\nThe Reseller acknowledges that all intellectual property rights in the Products remain vested in the Company and shall not modify, reverse engineer or remove any proprietary notices from the Products.\n\nF. Trademark Licence\nThe Company grants the Reseller a non-exclusive, revocable licence to use the Company's trademarks solely to market the Products during the term.",
